      "S17.title": "S17 · Re-wearing an aso-ebi set at a different event",
      "S17.context": "She is 35, from Lagos. Two months ago she bought an aso-ebi for her cousin's wedding: a lace blouse and a George wrapper in wine. Now she is going to a church thanksgiving where nobody from that wedding will be present. She wants to re-wear it.",
      "S17-D": "The wine George wrapper with a plain white T-shirt and trainers."
    }
